      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THIS IS ART (6) showed good early speed and led throughout to score her maiden two back then finished fourth last start and beaten 10 lengths at this track over 520m (30.75). Back to track where she won her maiden. Key player on best and worth another chance. BREMER BOY (3) was prominent throughout off a low draw but dropped right out when 7th over 457m at Q Lakeside in a Grade 6. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Leading chance. HIGH LEAK (2) jumped from this box last time and also the same course and distance when a 9 length second (30.65) in a Grade 6. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. BOURBON AND COKE (1) collected a minor prize last start over this track and distance - must be considered.",
